      "role": "user",
      "content": "been thinking about this a lot lately. feels like my life has just been... slowly getting smaller. not in some dramatic way. just piece by piece over the years. marriage ended, my friend dave passed, my back's been bad for a while now so i can't do half the things i used to, my son moved to australia and we barely talk. each thing on its own wasn't the end of the world. but now i look around and there's just... not much left. it's like watching a tide go out. slowly. and now the beach is mostly just empty sand.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
